================================================================================
Data Files and Their Sources
================================================================================

This section lists the third-party sources that have records in the data
files of this repository, and the terms each publisher attaches to them. It
describes the files as they stand in this revision. Row counts were read on
24 September 2026 at commit 5094d72a; they change at every refresh (monthly
for the BIC data, weekly for the sanctions and EPC data). This section is not
legal advice: where a publisher's terms have not been established, it says so.

Files concerned:
  data/bic.sqlite
  data/compliance.sqlite
  frontend/data/registers/*.json, frontend/data/countries.json and
    frontend/app/[locale]/playground/captured-iban.json (API responses
    exported for the website; they repeat records from the sources below)
  src/db/bic_data.json (composite map from national bank codes to BICs)
  src/db/nl-psp.json
  src/lib/fi-register.ts
  scripts/data/eu-emi-register-2026-05-22.json
  scripts/data/iban-registry-2026-05-22.json

Earlier commits of this repository, and forks of it, keep copies of these
files. The data in those copies remains subject to its publishers' terms.

Each source is listed in one of three groups:
  A. terms that permit reproduction, under the conditions stated;
  B. terms not yet confirmed;
  C. present today, not covered by the MIT License, not redistributable
     here, and being moved out of the public repository.

