Banco de España, list of monetary financial institutions
  Where: data/bic.sqlite, table bde_mfi (238 rows, list dated
         31 August 2026).
  Attribution required by the Banco de España:
         Own elaboration based on data from the Banco de España website (www.bde.es)
  Terms: reproduction "faithfully, without any manipulation or alteration of
         the content", citing the Banco de España as the source. Where the
         information is sold, buyers must be told, before they pay and each
