         charge; served with every API response that uses it:
         This information may be obtained free of charge from the Banco de España website at www.bde.es.
         Codes are stored without their padding spaces, and codes that
         designate money-market funds rather than banks are left out;
         whether that counts as a manipulation has not been confirmed with
         the Banco de España.
         https://www.bde.es/wbe/en/pie/aviso-legal/

